COMMENT ON COLUMN property_event.event_type IS 'What happened. One of CREATED_SEALED, SEAL_CHANGED, CONTAINER_TYPE_CHANGE, MOVED, TRANSFERRED, RECEIVED, RETURNED, DISPOSAL_REQUIRED, DISPOSED, COMBINED, CREATED_IN_ERROR, REMOVED, REACTIVATED, LOCATION_CONFIRMED, or the five driven by prisoner movements - PRISONER_TRANSFERRED_OUT, PRISONER_RECEIVED, PRISONER_RELEASED, DIED_IN_CUSTODY, PRISONER_ADMITTED. RECEIVED confirms arrival of the existing container at another establishment, recording the user, time, sending and receiving prisons, seal and location. Each type implies a status. [Example: SEAL_CHANGED] [SAR: Y] [Sensitivity: NONE]';
